Changes made for this port:
- Ported the Forge 1.20.1-era code base to Minecraft 26.2 / NeoForge
  (lobby dimension and world preset, payloads, commands, events, rendering).
- Switched the dependency from the old `bingo` id to the ReBongo port
  (modId `bongo`, package io.github.noeppi_noeppi.mods.bongo).
- Default task/setting ids now use the `bongo:` namespace
  (bongo:hard / bongo:default); existing configs must be updated once.
- Merged/renamed several upstream classes into the current file layout;
  see CHANGES.md and the per-file headers.
- Fixed a raw-collection compile error in LobbyCommands.

------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Third-party content
------------------------------------------------------------------
This port does not contain Botania-derived assets. The bundled
bingolobby-preset.zip is the lobby world preset produced for this project
from the upstream dimension settings.

